  "Every card is entered, win or lose, and can win at most one final-draw prize. If every card is sold, each card has about a {0}% chance; with fewer cards sold, the chance is higher. Draw: {1}.": "Ana saka kowane kati, ko ya ci ko bai ci ba, kuma kati ɗaya zai iya cin kyautar zaɓen ƙarshe ɗaya kawai. Idan an sayar da duk katuna, kowane kati yana da damar kusan {0}%; idan aka sayar da ƙasa da haka, damar ta fi haka. Zaɓe: {1}.",
  "Rules": "Dokoki", "The rules for this cycle have not been published here.": "Ba a wallafa dokokin wannan zagaye a nan ba.",
  "Draft for legal review: this summary will be replaced by the approved privacy policy.": "Daftari don nazarin lauyoyi: za a maye gurbin wannan taƙaitaccen bayani da ingantacciyar manufar sirri.",
  "We collect your phone number, your verified identity (name, date of birth, identity number), your location state, your bank account for payouts, and a record of your purchases, results, prizes, withdrawals and messages.": "Muna tattara lambar wayarka, shaidarka da aka tabbatar (suna, ranar haihuwa, lambar shaida), jihar da kake, asusun bankinka don biya, da bayanan sayayya, sakamako, kyaututtuka, cirewa da saƙonninka.",
  "We use them to check that you are allowed to play, to run the games, pay prizes, keep you within your limits, meet the law and the regulator's requirements, and prevent fraud.": "Muna amfani da su don tabbatar an yarda ka yi wasa, gudanar da wasanni, biyan kyaututtuka, kiyaye ka cikin iyakokinka, cika doka da bukatun mai sa ido, da hana zamba.",
  "Identity and bank account numbers are stored encrypted or as one-way fingerprints. Your data is not sold. It is shared only with the identity, payment and messaging providers we use, auditors, and the authorities when the law requires.": "Ana adana lambobin shaida da na asusun banki a ɓoye ko a matsayin hatimi mara juyawa. Ba a sayar da bayananka. Ana raba su ne kawai da masu samar da shaida, biya da saƙonni da muke amfani da su, masu binciken kuɗi, da hukumomi idan doka ta bukata.",
  "News and offers are sent only if you agree, and you can stop them at any time on the Me page. You can ask Help and support for a copy of your data or to correct it.": "Ana aiko da labarai da tayi ne kawai idan ka yarda, kuma za ka iya dakatar da su kowane lokaci a shafin Ni. Za ka iya neman kwafin bayananka ko gyara su daga Taimako.",
  "Confirm it's really you": "Tabbatar cewa kai ne da gaske",
  "For a major prize or a large withdrawal we check that it is really you, so that someone with your phone and PIN cannot take it. It takes a few seconds and is done once.": "Don babbar kyauta ko cire kuɗi mai yawa muna tabbatar cewa kai ne da gaske, don kada wanda ya samu wayarka da PIN ɗinka ya karɓe ta. Yana ɗaukar 'yan daƙiƙoƙi kuma sau ɗaya ake yi.",
  "Simulation: in the live service your phone's camera takes a short live selfie, which is matched to the photo held for your identity number. Here the button stands in for it.": "Gwaji: a sabis na gaske kyamarar wayarka za ta ɗauki hoton fuskarka kai tsaye, a kwatanta shi da hoton da ke tare da lambar shaidarka. A nan maɓallin ne ke wakiltar hakan.",
  "Take the selfie check": "Yi gwajin hoton fuska",
  "Thank you — you can carry on.": "Na gode — za ka iya ci gaba.",
  "For this amount we need to see that it is really you. Take the quick selfie check first.": "Don wannan adadin muna bukatar ganin cewa kai ne da gaske. Fara yin gwajin hoton fuska.",
  "Verify your identity first.": "Fara tabbatar da shaidarka.",
  "All sales are final. When you start paying, your cards are held for you for 15 minutes, so your payment always gets them.": "Duk sayayya ta ƙare ba a mayarwa. Idan ka fara biya, ana riƙe maka katunanka na minti 15, don haka biyanka koyaushe yana samun su.",
  "Your money is in your wallet": "Kuɗinka yana cikin jakarka",
  "Your payment arrived after the cards held for you had been released, and none were left. Nothing is lost: the money is in your wallet, to buy cards or withdraw.": "Biyanka ya iso bayan an saki katunan da aka riƙe maka, kuma babu sauran kati. Babu abin da ya ɓace: kuɗin yana cikin jakarka, don sayen katuna ko cirewa.",
  "Open my wallet": "Buɗe jakata", "credited to your wallet": "an saka a jakarka",
